8,"Minyag, Eastern in China people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/21978/CH,"The Eastern Minyag people are defined by their Tibetan-based language, which is one of the Qiangic languages. They also go by Minyag or Minyak. They live in China's Sichuan Province, especially in the Lixian, Maoxian and Wnchuan regions. ... The part of Sichuan Province that the Eastern Minyag call home is noted for it's beauty. This language group has their own handicraft styles, music and dance.","Minyag, Western",Sino-Tibetan
9,MUSIC IN TIBET | Facts and Details,https://factsanddetails.com/china/cat6/sub36/item206.html,Every year they perform in the New Year Concert broadcast on Tibet TV. Some of the works they perform are musical pieces created by Tibetan musicians for Tibetan instruments in both Western and Tibetan forms.,"Minyag, Western",Sino-Tibetan
